        "",
        "",
        "",
        "Product Advantages",
        "1. Rational structure, simple installation and small footprint.\n2. Easy operation, stable separation performance, distinct product splitting, large throughput, high separation efficiency, high concentration ratio, high recovery rate and reliable operation.\n3. Light‑weight, moisture‑proof, rust‑proof and corrosion‑resistant. Strong adaptability to fluctuations of feed rate, pulp density, particle size and feed grade; no noise.",
